Z||000000||Will||04-21-2001||11:36 PM||||I <I>was</I> going to do the Beretta/GA thing that weekend, but I have been foiled by manufacturing incompetence!<P>I had the hubs machined and ready, but the new lug studs I bought at the local Car Quest place, made by Doorman were too large! I cracked one of the hubs before I knew! I measured the others, and they were all 0.010" bigger than the ones that came out!! WTF!<BR>Some idiotic maggot who is under the erroneous impression that he is an engineer should lose his @#$%^& job!!<P>Doorman is DEFINITELY going to hear about this!<P>Dammit!||||reg||1
